    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d14-a1">

                <pb facs="0092" n="12" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg12"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">certificate of birth.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >St. Joseph’s Church</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Tremont, N.
                                Y</hi>.</placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1901-07-10T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1877-07-25T00:00:00-05:00"
                    >undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p>Carl Schimaneck, son of Anton and Fanny Schimaneck, born on the 25th of February,
                    1877, was baptized on the 25th of July, 1877.</p>
                <p>Witnesses: Franziska Heisler and Joseph and Maria Lauzansky.</p>
                <p>Pastor: Rev. H. J. S. Tanner.</p>
                <closer><signed>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
